  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "879f077e-b0df-4b4a-8fd1-6c0216355f75",
    "name": "Azure API Management Gateway",
    "description": "The Azure API Management gateway acts as a reverse proxy between API consumers and backend services. It routes requests, applies policies (authentication, rate limiting, caching, transformation), and emits telemetry. The gateway proxies calls to APIs configured in the management plane.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Microsoft Azure",
